  "description": "A multi-country collection of official agricultural field boundary (cadastral parcel) datasets from national and regional government land-parcel registries across Europe, Brazil, and the United States, converted to the fiboa GeoParquet specification. Each asset holds parcel polygons, area metrics, and HCAT crop classification codes. The datasets (fiboa 0.3) are no longer updated and have moved to the Harmonized Field Boundary Data catalog hosted by Fields of the World.",
