  "readme": "## README.md\n# fiboa datasets (fiboa 0.3) \u2014 moved\n\n**These datasets are now published, updated and extended in the\n[Harmonized Field Boundary Data](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data) catalog\n(`s3://ftw/harmonized-field-data`), hosted by [Fields of the World](https://fieldsofthe.world).**\n\nThe new catalog holds the same national and regional field boundary datasets, converted to the\n[fiboa](https://github.com/fiboa/specification) schema with [fiboa-cli](https://github.com/fiboa/cli),\nwith more countries and, where the source offers them, every edition year:\n\n- [Catalog README](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data/README.md): all collections, their\n  sources, editions and licenses\n- [AGENTS.md](https://source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data/AGENTS.md): how to query across collections\n- [STAC catalog](https://data.source.coop/ftw/harmonized-field-data/catalog.json)\n- `s3://ftw/harmonized-field-data/*/latest/*.parquet`: the newest edition of every collection\n\nThe files in this repository are no longer updated. They stay available so existing links keep\nworking, but new work should read the catalog above.\n\nOlder datasets in the fiboa 0.2 format are in the other repositories of the\n[fiboa organization](https://source.coop/fiboa); they are superseded by the same catalog.\n",
